# The Network: blocked hosts that generic classification sends direct
#
# Expects Proxy. Must precede the download classification.
#
# Download classification exists to keep large transfers on domestic CDNs at line speed, and it treats these as download hosts. They are also blocked here, so direct means dead rather than fast.
#
# ghcr.io and formulae.brew.sh belong to this category too but live in config/Surge/GitHub/GitHub.list, so that they share an exit with the rest of GitHub. Working official registries that should stay DIRECT live in config/Surge/Library/Direct/Registries.list.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mega.nz
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mega.co.nz
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mega.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,archive.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gcr.io
